config RIVER_KWS_LEGACY_MODEL_COMPAT_EN
    bool "Build legacy KWS model compatibility ops"
    default n
    depends on RIVER_VOICE_CAPABILITY_KWS
    help
      Build legacy KWS operator compatibility for older embedded models
      that still require ops such as `MEAN` and `FULLY_CONNECTED`.
      Keep this disabled for the current no-MEAN baseline so unused op
      registrations and legacy-only strings stay out of the default image.

config RIVER_KWS_MEAN_PATCH_EN
    bool "Build temporary KWS MEAN patch"
    default n
    depends on RIVER_KWS_LEGACY_MODEL_COMPAT_EN
    depends on RIVER_VOICE_CAPABILITY_KWS
    help
      Build the project-side KWS MEAN registration patch used only for
      legacy embedded models that still need MEAN bring-up workarounds.
      Disable this when moving to a no-MEAN KWS model so the patch code
      stays out of the image and out of the mainline code path.

